WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.514
Hi! Look, think, and write a whole sentence. Today we'll learn to write sentences.

2
00:00:08.664 --> 00:00:11.682
A sentence tells who and what they do.

3
00:00:11.832 --> 00:00:15.714
The boy is who, runs is what: The boy runs.

4
00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:19.314
We can add where: The boy runs in the park.

5
00:00:19.464 --> 00:00:24.066
A describing word makes it more interesting.

6
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:27.426
Say the sentence in your head before writing.

7
00:00:27.576 --> 00:00:30.330
Leave a space between words.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.050
Start with a capital and end with a full stop.

9
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.018
Check: is there a who? Is there a what?

10
00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:43.290
Watch out! In the park isn't a whole sentence!

11
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.242
It doesn't say who or what they do.

12
00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:50.802
Add them: The girls play in the park.

13
00:00:50.952 --> 00:00:59.826
Your turn! Put the words in order: runs, the dog. Pause and think.

14
00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:06.066
Who first, then what: The dog runs. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:06.216 --> 00:01:14.826
Another one! Is a big red ball a whole sentence? Pause and think.

16
00:01:14.976 --> 00:01:20.130
There's no action, so no. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:28.794
Here's another! How do we fix: the cat sleeps? Pause and think.

18
00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:35.730
Capital start, full stop: The cat sleeps. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:43.914
Try one more! Add where to: Mum cooks. Pause and think.

20
00:01:44.064 --> 00:01:49.074
Mum cooks in the kitchen. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:49.224 --> 00:01:58.290
Try one more! Put the words in order: is, the sun, hot. Pause and think.

22
00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:03.138
The sun is hot. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:11.322
Try one more! Which is a whole sentence? Pause and think.

24
00:02:11.472 --> 00:02:17.274
Birds fly has a who and an action. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:17.424 --> 00:02:27.450
Try one more! Add a describing word: I have a, ___, bag. Pause and think.

26
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:33.546
For example new: I have a new bag. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:41.586
Last one! Which is a whole sentence? Pause and think.

28
00:02:41.736 --> 00:02:47.730
The fish swims has a who and an action. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:55.481
Remember: a sentence needs who and what. Say it first, then write with a capital, spaces and a full stop.

30
00:02:55.631 --> 00:03:00.233
Write one sentence about what you did today!

